        "source_solution": "Full source results are 5*10^18,2*10^-6,2.31*10^6,1.25*10^6,2.(259)*10^-2,4.(285714)*10^-10. Quotients: 2*10^(-2-4);(1/8)*10^(5+2)=1.25*10^6;(61/27)*10^-2=2.(259)*10^-2;(3/7)*10^-9=(30/7)*10^-10=4.(285714)*10^-10.",
